<h1 class="m-t-0">About California</h1>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section-understated">
  <div class="container p-y-lg">
    <div class="col-md-10">
      <p class="lead">
        Californians deserve a government that works for them and with them. One
        that will work to ensure opportunity and justice. We are building a
        California not for the few, but for all — including those who have
        historically been left out.
      </p>
      <p class="lead">
        We are doing the work to make our state a place for every Californian
        and all the diversity that makes us strong. Our state will be known as a
        place where everyone is respected, protected, and connected.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<!--Branches-->
<div class="container p-b-lg">
  <h2>California government</h2>
  <h3 class="m-b-lg">Branches of government</h3>
  <div class="row p-t-lg">
    <div class="col-md-4 mt-5 mb-5 mb-md-4 mt-md-0">
      <div
        class="bg-white p-x-md p-b-md pos-rel h-100 brd-solid-1 brd-gray-200 d-flex flex-column rounded-10">
        <img
          src="/images/about-branch-1.webp"
          class="img-fluid pos-rel p-a m-t-minus-70 width-90pct relative-centered-x"
          alt="The American flag and State of California flag are raised in front of the Sacramento State Capitol." />
        <h4 class="m-b m-t-md text-left">Executive</h4>
        <p class="m-b text-left">
          The Governor leads California's executive branch, which includes
          elected officials and administrators.
        </p>
        <p class="text-center mt-auto m-b-md">
          <a
            href="https://www.gov.ca.gov/"
            class="btn btn-primary btn-hover w-100"
            >Visit the Governor’s website</a
          >
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4 mt-5 mb-5 mb-md-4 mt-md-0">
      <div
        class="bg-white p-x-md p-b-md pos-rel h-100 brd-solid-1 brd-gray-200 d-flex flex-column rounded-10">
        <img
          src="/images/about-branch-2.webp"
          class="img-fluid pos-rel p-a m-t-minus-70 width-90pct relative-centered-x"
          alt="A microphone is propped up over a wooden desk at a courthouse." />
        <h4 class="m-b m-t-md text-left">Legislative</h4>
        <p class="m-b text-left">
          The California Legislature votes on state laws and drafts legislation.
        </p>
        <p class="text-center mt-auto m-b-md">
          <a
            href="https://leginfo.legislature.ca.gov/"
            class="btn btn-primary btn-hover w-100"
            >Visit the Legislature’s website</a
          >
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4 mt-5 mb-5 mb-md-4 mt-md-0">
      <div
        class="bg-white p-x-md p-b-md pos-rel h-100 brd-solid-1 brd-gray-200 d-flex flex-column rounded-10">
        <img
          src="/images/about-branch-3.webp"
          class="img-fluid pos-rel p-a m-t-minus-70 width-90pct relative-centered-x"
          alt="The American flag waves in front of the United States Court House." />
        <h4 class="m-b m-t-md text-left">Judicial</h4>
        <p class="m-b text-left">
          The judicial branch interprets and applies laws at state and local
          levels.
        </p>
        <p class="text-center mt-auto m-b-md">
          <a
            href="https://www.courts.ca.gov/"
            class="btn btn-primary btn-hover w-100"
            >Visit the CA Courts website</a
          >
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!--Programs-->
  <h2 class="h3 mt-4 mb-3">More about our government</h2>
  <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 flex-column flex-md-row m-b-md">
    <a
      class="btn btn-outline-primary text-nowrap"
      href="https://ebudget.ca.gov/"
      >California budget</a
    >

    <a
      class="btn btn-outline-primary text-nowrap"
      href="https://www.sos.ca.gov/elections"
      >Elections and voting</a
    >

    <a
      class="btn btn-outline-primary text-nowrap"
      href="https://www.sos.ca.gov/elections/who-are-my-representatives"
      >Look up my representatives</a
    >

    <a
      class="btn btn-outline-primary text-nowrap"
      href="https://selfhelp.courts.ca.gov/"
      >Guide to CA courts</a
    >
  </div>
</div>

<!--Priorities-->
<section class="section-understated p-y-lg">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="m-t-0">Current priorities</h2>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-4 mt-2 mb-2 mb-md-4 mt-md-0">
        <div
          class="bg-white bg-gray-50-hover p-x-md p-b-md pos-rel h-100 brd-solid-1 brd-gray-100 transform-scale-1_05--hover transition-0_3 d-flex flex-column rounded-10">
          <h3 class="h5 font-size-20">
            <a
              href="/LAfires/"
              class="color-p2 link-before no-underline d-block">
              2025 LA fires</a
            >
          </h3>
          <p class="m-b gray-900">
            2025 Early January Los Angeles County Fires: Resources for Impacted
            Individuals
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 mt-2 mb-2 mb-md-4 mt-md-0">
        <div
          class="bg-white bg-gray-50-hover p-x-md p-b-md pos-rel h-100 brd-solid-1 brd-gray-100 transform-scale-1_05--hover transition-0_3 d-flex flex-column rounded-10">
          <h3 class="h5 font-size-20">
            <a
              href="https://www.cdph.ca.gov/programs/ohe/abortion/pages/home.aspx"
              class="color-p2 link-before no-underline d-block">
              Abortion access</a
            >
          </h3>
          <p class="m-b gray-900">
            Abortion is legal and protected in California. Get accurate
            information about abortion services in California.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 mt-2 mb-2 mb-md-4 mt-md-0">
        <div
          class="bg-white bg-gray-50-hover p-x-md p-b-md pos-rel h-100 brd-solid-1 brd-gray-100 transform-scale-1_05--hover transition-0_3 d-flex flex-column rounded-10">
          <h3 class="h5 font-size-20">
            <a
              href="https://build.ca.gov/"
              class="color-p2 link-before no-underline d-block">
              Building California</a
            >
          </h3>
          <p class="m-b gray-900">
            California is making a big investment in infrastructure (roads,
            clean energy, and more). Find out about key projects in your area.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 mt-2 mb-2 mb-md-4 mt-md-0">
        <div
          class="bg-white bg-gray-50-hover p-x-md p-b-md pos-rel h-100 brd-solid-1 brd-gray-100 transform-scale-1_05--hover transition-0_3 d-flex flex-column rounded-10">
          <h3 class="h5 font-size-20">
            <a
              href="https://climateaction.ca.gov/"
              class="color-p2 link-before no-underline d-block">
              Climate action</a
            >
          </h3>
          <p class="m-b gray-900">
            Everyone can be a part of solving climate change. There are programs
            for everyone, whether you rent or own a home.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 mt-2 mb-2 mb-md-4 mt-md-0">
        <div
          class="bg-white bg-gray-50-hover p-x-md p-b-md pos-rel h-100 brd-solid-1 brd-gray-100 transform-scale-1_05--hover transition-0_3 d-flex flex-column rounded-10">
          <h3 class="h5 font-size-20">
            <a
              href="/gasfacts/"
              class="color-p2 link-before no-underline d-block">
              Gas facts</a
            >
          </h3>
          <p class="m-b gray-900">
            California is acting to protect our people from gas price spikes.
            We’re working toward a future of cleaner air and better roads for
            all. 
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 mt-2 mb-2 mb-md-4 mt-md-0">
        <div
          class="bg-white bg-gray-50-hover p-x-md p-b-md pos-rel h-100 brd-solid-1 brd-gray-100 transform-scale-1_05--hover transition-0_3 d-flex flex-column rounded-10">
          <h3 class="h5 font-size-20">
            <a
              href="https://www.reducetherisk.ca.gov/"
              class="color-p2 link-before no-underline d-block">
              Gun safety</a
            >
          </h3>
          <p class="m-b gray-900">
            California is providing communities the opportunity to safely access
            help, care and resources to prevent gun violence.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 mt-2 mb-2 mb-md-4 mt-md-0">
        <div
          class="bg-white bg-gray-50-hover p-x-md p-b-md pos-rel h-100 brd-solid-1 brd-gray-100 transform-scale-1_05--hover transition-0_3 d-flex flex-column rounded-10">
          <h3 class="h5 font-size-20">
            <a
              href="/immigration/"
              class="color-p2 link-before no-underline d-block">
              Immigration</a
            >
          </h3>
          <p class="m-b gray-900">
            The information and resources available for immigrant families,
            including public programs, schools, and federal immigration
            policies.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-4 mt-2 mb-2 mb-md-4 mt-md-0">
        <div
          class="bg-white bg-gray-50-hover p-x-md p-b-md pos-rel h-100 brd-solid-1 brd-gray-100 transform-scale-1_05--hover transition-0_3 d-flex flex-column rounded-10">
          <h3 class="h5 font-size-20">
            <a
              href="https://www.mentalhealth.ca.gov/"
              class="color-p2 link-before no-underline d-block">
              Mental health care for all</a
            >
          </h3>
          <p class="m-b gray-900">
            California is transforming our entire mental health system. The
            result: better behavioral health care for all Californians.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-4 mt-2 mb-2 mb-md-4 mt-md-0">
        <div
          class="bg-white bg-gray-50-hover p-x-md p-b-md pos-rel h-100 brd-solid-1 brd-gray-100 transform-scale-1_05--hover transition-0_3 d-flex flex-column rounded-10">
          <h3 class="h5 font-size-20">
            <a
              href="https://www.cdph.ca.gov/Programs/CCDPHP/opioids/Pages/landingpage.aspx"
              class="color-p2 link-before no-underline d-block">
              Opioids</a
            >
          </h3>
          <p class="m-b gray-900">
            Opioids are the leading cause of drug overdose deaths. California is
            doubling down to combat the opioid crisis and save lives.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

