  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-4 m-b-md">
      <div
        class="bg-white pos-rel h-100 brd-solid-1 brd-gray-200 d-flex flex-column m-b-md rounded">
        <img
          src="/images/about-animal.webp"
          class="img-fluid rounded-top"
          alt="A large, brown grizzly bear wades in a river bordered by grassy soil." />
        <h3 class="h4 m-b m-t-md text-center">State animal</h3>
        <p class="text-center m-b-md">California grizzly bear</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4 m-b-md">
      <div
        class="bg-white pos-rel h-100 brd-solid-1 brd-gray-200 d-flex flex-column m-b-md rounded">
        <img
          src="/images/about-flower.webp"
          class="img-fluid rounded-top"
          alt="Orangey-yellow poppies are open toward the sun against a backdrop of green stems and leaves." />
        <h3 class="h4 m-b m-t-md text-center">State flower</h3>
        <p class="text-center m-b-md">California poppy</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4 m-b-md">
      <div
        class="bg-white pos-rel h-100 brd-solid-1 brd-gray-200 d-flex flex-column m-b-md rounded">
        <img
          src="/images/about-tree.webp"
          class="img-fluid rounded-top"
          alt="A massive, hollowed, redwood tree trunk stands in front of smaller redwood trees in a forest." />
        <h3 class="h4 m-b m-t-md text-center">State tree</h3>
        <p class="text-center m-b-md">California redwood</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="pt-4">
    <a
      href="https://www.library.ca.gov/california-history/state-symbols/"
      class="btn btn-primary btn-lg transform-scale-1_05--hover transition-0_3 p-x-md"
      >View all state symbols</a
    >
  </div>
</div>

<!--Numbers-->
<div class="section-primary topo-lines">
  <div class="container pt-1 p-b-md">
    <h2 class="h2">California milestones</h2>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-3 mb-4">
        <div
          class="bg-primary text-center p-x-md p-a-md pos-rel h-100 rounded-4">
          <p class="text-3-5rem m-b-0">
            <span
              class="scroll-counter"
              data-counter-time="1000"
              style="visibility: visible;"
              >1.5</span
            >m
          </p>
          <p>zero emission vehicles in the state (by 2025)</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-3 mb-4">
        <div
          class="bg-primary text-center p-x-md p-a-md pos-rel h-100 rounded-4">
          <p class="text-3-5rem m-b-0">
            <span
              class="scroll-counter"
              data-counter-time="1500"
              style="visibility: visible;"
              >90</span
            >%
          </p>
          <p>clean energy by 2035</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-3 mb-4">
        <div
          class="bg-primary text-center p-x-md p-a-md pos-rel h-100 rounded-4">
          <p class="text-3-5rem m-b-0">
            <span
              class="scroll-counter"
              data-counter-time="2000"
              style="visibility: visible;"
              >230</span
            >+
          </p>
          <p>state government agencies serving you</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-3 mb-4">
        <div
          class="bg-primary text-center p-x-md p-a-md pos-rel h-100 rounded-4">
          <p class="text-3-5rem m-b-0">
            $<span
              class="scroll-counter"
              data-counter-time="2300"
              style="visibility: visible;"
              >60</span
            >b+
          </p>
          <p>generated to support our communities</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!--Visitiong California-->
<div class="container p-b-lg">
  <h2>Visiting California</h2>
  <div class="row p-b-md">
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <article
        class="pos-rel h-100 d-flex flex-column transform-scale-1_05--hover transition-0_3">
        <figure
          class="pos-rel border-0 pb-5 mb-5 pb-xl-5 mb-xl-4 pb-lg-5 mb-lg-4 pb-md-4 mb-md-4">
          <img
            src="/images/highlight-1.webp"
            class="img-fluid p-a pos-abs absolute-centered-x width-80pct"
            alt="A light skinned white man and woman look at photography displays at an exhibit at the SF MOMA." />
        </figure>
        <div
          class="bg-white bg-gray-50-hover text-center p-t-xxl p-x-md p-b-md  brd-solid-1 brd-gray-200 rounded-10 h-100">
          <h3 class="h4 m-b text-left">
            <a
              href="https://www.visitcalifornia.com/places-to-visit/"
              class="link-before no-underline">
              Places to visit</a
            >
          </h3>
          <p class="m-b text-left gray-900">
            Discover places to visit and learn about California's various
            regions and lively cities.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <article
        class="pos-rel h-100 d-flex flex-column transform-scale-1_05--hover transition-0_3">
        <figure
          class="pos-rel border-0 pb-5 mb-5 pb-xl-5 mb-xl-4 pb-lg-5 mb-lg-4 pb-md-4 mb-md-4">
          <img
            src="/images/highlight-2.webp"
            class="img-fluid p-a pos-abs absolute-centered-x width-80pct"
            alt="Waves flow out from an enclave surrounded by rock formations at Julia Pfeiffer Beach in the daytime." />
        </figure>
        <div
          class="bg-white bg-gray-50-hover text-center p-t-xxl p-x-md p-b-md  brd-solid-1 brd-gray-200 rounded-10 h-100">
          <h3 class="h4 m-b text-left">
            <a
              href="https://www.parks.ca.gov/Find-a-Park"
              class="link-before no-underline">
              State parks</a
            >
          </h3>
          <p class="m-b text-left gray-900">
            Visit California's state parks. They offer diverse, natural,
            cultural, and recreational resources.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <article
        class="pos-rel h-100 d-flex flex-column transform-scale-1_05--hover transition-0_3">
        <figure
          class="pos-rel border-0 pb-5 mb-5 pb-xl-5 mb-xl-4 pb-lg-5 mb-lg-4 pb-md-4 mb-md-4">
          <img
            src="/images/highlight-3.webp"
            class="img-fluid p-a pos-abs absolute-centered-x width-80pct"
            alt="A green tent surrounded by redwood trees is pitched at a campsite in Big Basin Redwoods State Park." />
        </figure>
        <div
          class="bg-white bg-gray-50-hover text-center p-t-xxl p-x-md p-b-md  brd-solid-1 brd-gray-200 rounded-10 h-100">
          <h3 class="h4 m-b text-left">
            <a
              href="https://www.reservecalifornia.com/"
              class="link-before no-underline">
              Camping reservations</a
            >
          </h3>
          <p class="m-b text-left gray-900">
            Book your next camping adventure. You can choose from 15,000
            campsites across 279 parks.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</main>
